{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-title='Management'>\r\n\t\t\tManagement\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"df and du for disk space, directory sizes, and finding deleted files that still hold space.","label":"Disk","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file","label":"File","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>df<\/code> reports disk space. <code class='inline'>du<\/code> reports disk usage of files and directories.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Disk space<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>df<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Disk usage<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-f<\/code>. <code class='inline'>-a<\/code> includes files. <code class='inline'>-c<\/code> prints a total.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>du -f\ndu -a\ndu -c<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDirectory-wise size, human readable (mac):\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>du -sh *<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLimit depth:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>du --max-depth=1<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Deletion of locked files<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLocked files can be deleted but still occupy disk space. Free space then shows a lower count.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: listing these requires <code class='inline'>sudo<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGet locked deleted files:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>sudo \/usr\/sbin\/lsof | grep deleted<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file' data-title='File' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>File<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-title='Management'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Management<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}